{
    "chapter_num": 12,
    "verses_count": 44,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Parable of the Wicked Vinedressers"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He began to speak to them in parables: "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“A man planted a vineyard and set a hedge around it, dug a place for the wine vat and built a tower. And he leased it to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "tenant farmers"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "vinedressers and went into a far country."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Now at vintage-time he sent a servant to the vinedressers, that he might receive some of the fruit of the vineyard from the vinedressers."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And they took him and beat him and sent him away empty-handed."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Again he sent them another servant,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits and at him they threw stones"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "and at him they threw stones, wounded him in the head, and sent him away shamefully treated."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And again he sent another, and him they killed; and many others,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "beating some and killing some."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Therefore still having one son, his beloved, he also sent him to them last, saying, ‘They will respect my son.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But those"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "tenant farmers"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "vinedressers said among themselves, ‘This is the heir. Come, let us kill him, and the inheritance will be ours.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "So they took him and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "killed him and cast him out of the vineyard."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Therefore what will the owner of the vineyard do? He will come and destroy the vinedressers, and give the vineyard to others."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Have you not even read this Scripture:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘The stone which the builders rejected"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Has become the chief cornerstone."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "This was the Lord’s doing,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And it is marvelous in our eyes’?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they sought to lay hands on Him, but feared the multitude, for they knew He had spoken the parable against them. So they left Him and went away."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Pharisees: Is It Lawful to Pay Taxes to Caesar?"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they sent to Him some of the Pharisees and the Herodians, to catch Him in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "His"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " words. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When they had come, they said to Him, “Teacher, we know that You are true, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Court no man’s favor"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "care about no one; for You do not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. look at the face of men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "regard the person of men, but teach the way of God in truth. Is it lawful to pay taxes to Caesar, or not? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Shall we pay, or shall we not pay?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But He, knowing their hypocrisy, said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Why do you test Me? Bring Me a denarius that I may see it.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they brought "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Whose image and inscription is this?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " They said to Him, “Caesar’s.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jesus answered and said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Pay"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Render to Caesar the things that are Caesar’s, and to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "God the things that are God’s.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they marveled at Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Sadducees: What About the Resurrection?"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Sadducees, who say there is no resurrection, came to Him; and they asked Him, saying: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Teacher, Moses wrote to us that if a man’s brother dies, and leaves "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " wife behind, and leaves no children, his brother should take his wife and raise up offspring for his brother. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now there were seven brothers. The first took a wife; and dying, he left no offspring. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the second took her, and he died; nor did he leave any offspring. And the third likewise. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the seven had her and left no offspring. Last of all the woman died also. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, in the resurrection, when they rise, whose wife will she be? For all seven had her as wife.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus answered and said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Are you not therefore"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or deceived"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "mistaken, because you do not know the Scriptures nor the power of God?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For when they rise from the dead, they neither marry nor are given in marriage, but"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "are like angels in heaven."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But concerning the dead, that they"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "rise, have you not read in the book of Moses, in the burning bush passage, how God spoke to him, saying,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘I am the God of Abraham, the God of Isaac, and the God of Jacob’?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "He is not the God of the dead, but the God of the living. You are therefore greatly"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or deceived"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "mistaken.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Scribes: Which Is the First Commandment of All?"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then one of the scribes came, and having heard them reasoning together, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU seeing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perceiving that He had answered them well, asked Him, “Which is the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "foremost"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "first commandment of all?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus answered him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“The"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "foremost"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "first of all the commandments is:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘Hear, O Israel, the Lord our God, the Lord is one."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And you shall"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "love the Lord your God with all your heart, with all your soul, with all your mind, and with all your strength.’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits the rest of v. 30."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "This is the first commandment."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "And the second, like it, is this:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘You shall love your neighbor as yourself.’ There is no other commandment greater than"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "these.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the scribe said to Him, “Well "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "said,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Teacher. You have spoken the truth, for there is one God, and there is no other but He. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And to love Him with all the heart, with all the understanding, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits with all the soul"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "with all the soul, and with all the strength, and to love one’s neighbor as oneself, is more than all the whole burnt offerings and sacrifices.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when Jesus saw that he answered wisely, He said to him, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“You are not far from the kingdom of God.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But after that no one dared question Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus: How Can David Call His Descendant Lord?"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jesus answered and said, while He taught in the temple, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“How is it that the scribes say that the Christ is the Son of David?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "For David himself said"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "by the Holy Spirit:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "‘The Lord said to my Lord,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Sit at My right hand,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Till I make Your enemies Your footstool.” ’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Therefore David himself calls Him ‘Lord’; how is He then his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Son?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the common people heard Him gladly."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Beware of the Scribes"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then He said to them in His teaching, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Beware of the scribes, who desire to go around in long robes,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "love greetings in the marketplaces,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "best seats in the synagogues, and the best places at feasts,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "who devour widows’ houses, and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "for appearance’ sake"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "for a pretense make long prayers. These will receive greater condemnation.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Widow’s Two Mites"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 41,
                    "num_str": "41",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Jesus sat opposite the treasury and saw how the people put money into the treasury. And many "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " rich put in much. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 42,
                    "num_str": "42",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then one poor widow came and threw in two "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. lepta, very small copper coins"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "mites, which make a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "A Roman coin"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "quadrans. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 43,
                    "num_str": "43",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So He called His disciples to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Himself"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Assuredly, I say to you that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "this poor widow has put in more than all those who have given to the treasury;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 44,
                    "num_str": "44",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "for they all put in out of their abundance, but she out of her poverty put in all that she had,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "her whole livelihood.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
